--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 5  | Text: 你如果说兜里
Segment #2   [00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 从原本一块钱拿不出来
Segment #3   [00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,240] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 变成兜里有十万块钱
Segment #4   [00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,040] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 有二十万块钱了
Segment #5   [00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,800] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 12 | Text: 你以为这是所谓的脱离了底层
Segment #6   [00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,480] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 3  | Text: 但不是的
Segment #7   [00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,580] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 13 | Text: 你的大脑还停留在底层人的大脑
Segment #8   [00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,860] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 你看它事物的方式和理解
Segment #9   [00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,960] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 理解问题的理解能力
Segment #10  [00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 都还停留在这个原始阶段
Segment #11  [00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,440] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不明白钱的价值
Segment #12  [00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:19,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 8  | Text: 你也不明白朋友的作用
Segment #13  [00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,940] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 你更不明白你的时间的状况性
Segment #14  [00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:24,120] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 10 | Text: 你只是在一个偶然的机会下
Segment #15  [00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,400] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 7  | Text: 瞎摸碰到死号子
Segment #16  [00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,120] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 4  | Text: 攒到钱了
Segment #17  [00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,900] | Elapsed:  15.46s | Words: 9  | Text: 并不代表你就不是底层了
Segment #18  [00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,900] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是你没有赚过钱
Segment #19  [00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:30,920] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后又反贫
Segment #20  [00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:31,980] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 然后又赚到钱
Segment #21  [00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:32,980] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 你永远是底层
Segment #22  [00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,360] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 人赚到钱以后
Segment #23  [00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,540] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 他会有什么反应的
Segment #24  [00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,820] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 赚到钱再反贫
Segment #25  [00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:37,560] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 再赚到钱
Segment #26  [00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,540] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 10 | Text: 有很多人大概率就反不了贫了
Segment #27  [00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,660] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 因为他懂得几件事
Segment #28  [00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:41,240] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 2  | Text: 首先第一
Segment #29  [00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,520] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 不再去证明自己
Segment #30  [00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,240] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 不会再有很多的
Segment #31  [00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,240] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 为情绪价值买单的事
Segment #32  [00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,840] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 会明白了钱的重要性
Segment #33  [00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:48,840] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的每一分钱
Segment #34  [00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,380] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 这都是你的士兵
Segment #35  [00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,260] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 这都是你的子弹
Segment #36  [00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,100] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 你要绝对掌控
Segment #37  [00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,380] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 12 | Text: 就像我之前给你们分享的关键一样
Segment #38  [00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:56,040] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是一定要去赚第一次
Segment #39  [00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,260] | Elapsed:  33.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 有钱的人的钱
